  "body": "Set on a full site of approx. 809 sq m, this solid 1970’s built home would love a builder to\r\ngive it some attention or, subject to council requirements, develop the site\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a generous kitchen flowing seamlessly into the open plan dining\r\narea, perfect for everyday living and entertaining, and on into the lounge and deck with sea\r\nviews.\r\n\r\nA modern bathroom and separate WC services the bedrooms level. Storage is plentiful\r\nthroughout, complemented by an internal rumpus area, to work from home or provide space\r\nfor your teenagers and a substantial enclosed area under the house.\r\n\r\nA new roof in 2019 gives peace of mind\r\n\r\nConveniently located within walking distance to schools, with public transport at your\r\ndoorstep, and just minutes to Torbay shops and Long Bay and Waiake Beaches, this is a\r\nproperty offering space and flexibility.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
